name: Accepted file membership, inherited context, finite discovery and Report recovery
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scoped_discovery.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | initialized
submit: campaign scoped-study
require-live-snap: 30 3 job(s) | fixed-plan
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 30 APPROVED STUDY | approved-study
keys: Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 30 Exact read scope: app | exact-read-policy
expect: Shared files provide context only
ask: Can the operator inspect the accepted scope, constrained tools, frozen snippet limits and allowance before starting the three fixed jobs?
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 L starts its fixed jobs | fixed-jobs
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 dispatcher pid | running
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scoped_discovery.py @TMP_TARGET @ART completed
keys: r
require-live-snap: 30 3 completed | completed
keys: Escape
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 30 RESULT READY | scan-result
nav-mode:
keys: u
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/open-finding.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Labeled scope observation | finding
submit: dismiss false_positive Owned workflow fixture; no security defect claimed
require-live-snap: 30 rejected_false_positive | reviewed-finding
submit: report
require-live-snap: 30 Scope: study scoped-study | report
expect: 6 committed / 8 calls
expect: 2 protected review remaining
keys: p
require-live-snap: 30 observations outside discovery | scoped-report-details
ask: Does the report distinguish accepted findings from retained observations outside discovery, while preserving exact scope and protected spending?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: report-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: report-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: report-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: report-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: report-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-1-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-2-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-3-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-4-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-5-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-6-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-7-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-8-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-9-40x12
ask: Are scope, retained observations and spending reachable at 40x12 without overlapping controls or implying complete coverage?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1
resize: 80x24
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: report
require-live-snap: 30 Scope: study scoped-study | recovered-report
expect: 6 committed / 8 calls
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scoped_discovery.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart preserve the selected scoped study, review decision and accounting without starting additional work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
